{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:STsE19underestimatedCountSivp::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","extendedModule":"Swift","title":"underestimatedCount","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"underestimatedCount"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["Swift"],"name":"Cliques"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/underestimatedCount","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/underestimatedcount"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"underestimatedCount","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence.underestimatedCount"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/underestimatedCount":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/underestimatedCount","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/underestimatedcount","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"underestimatedCount","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"underestimatedCount"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"title":"MaximalCliques"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"type":"topic","title":"Cliques","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques"}}}